tps://elfartworld.com/static/custom.htmlAbout \"Custom Upload\"Encouraging creativity. Creators, feel free to @ our official account — ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:05:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868310-1844751498221392","game_id":"steam-4868310","kind":"announcement","title":"We've hit 100,000 wishlists!","summary":"It's been exactly one week since the demo launched, and today we officially passed 100,000 wishlists! We're blown away by your support—this is far beyond anything our team expected, and it's only strengthened our commitment to making this game the best it can be!Here's what we've fixed over the past week (full details in the Steam announcement):Added a character reset option to prevent characters from disappearing from the screenAdded an option to turn off the counterAdded frame rate options to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:53:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868310-1844115010504512","game_id":"steam-4868310","kind":"announcement","title":"New \"Disable Counter\" Feature & Related Notes","summary":"Feature UpdateWe've added a \\ feature. You can now turn off the keyboard/mouse counter in the settings.You can re-enable it at any time after disabling.When disabled, your character will no longer sync with your keystrokes.We want to emphasize: whether enabled or disabled, in every version, we never record what you type — the counter simply increments by 1. The demo version also has no network activity beyond Steam and the official Unity SDK.We've improved the onboarding flow: the counter featur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T15:10:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868310-1844115010501520","game_id":"steam-4868310","kind":"update","title":"\"Character House\"— First Update Announcement (With Easter Eggs)","summary":"\\New Character Reset Feature If your character accidentally falls off the screen, you can now bring them back with a single click from the taskbar. Sorry for letting your character get locked in the little black room (＞人＜；).Taskbar Quick Pin Toggle You can now quickly turn \"Always on Top\" on and off from the taskbar. If a character gets in the way during an immersive gaming session, switch it with one click — no more digging through the settings.New Frame Rate Selection (30/60/unlimited) to redu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T14:20:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4868310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4868310":"2026-10-26T04:48:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4868310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5166840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4868310","app_id":4868310,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"babd3b9b830037c609e9ae57b85aa4fd6c5ec6307070c02bc9f1ffdee0eb5245","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"「캐릭터 하우스: 치비 메이트」는 커스터마이징과 데스크톱 펫 플레이를 결합한 캐주얼 방치형 수집 게임입니다. 수백 가지 파츠를 자유롭게 조합해 세상에 하나뿐인 나만의 데스크톱 펫을 만들어 보세요. 일하거나 공부하는 동안 나란히 앉아 타이핑에 맞춰 함께 움직이고, 몰래 구석에 숨어 조용히 곁을 지켜주기도 합니다. 방치해 두면 보상이 계속 쌓이고, 액세서리 추첨·합성과 설정 카드 수집으로 개성과 모습을 풍성하게 채워 보세요. 친구와 온라인으로 서로의 룸을 오가며 정성껏 꾸민 펫을 공유하면 함께하는 즐거움도 두 배가 됩니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Yinengjie"}],"developers":[{"name":"Yinengjie"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_year"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Character House PV1","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1788417611","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4868310/1937465308/dc5fb3d8b713e4879309c2b12efea70b632990b6/1787304822/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4868310/1937465308/dc5fb3d8b713e4879309c2b12efea70b632990b6/1787304822/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4868310/1937465308/dc5fb3d8b713e4879309c2b12efea70b632990b6/1787304822/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4868310/1937465308/dc5fb3d8b713e4879309c2b12efea70b632990b6/1787304822/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4868310/1937465308/dc5fb3d8b713e4879309c2b12efea70b632990b6/1787304822/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257402497/94f4d5b9443e805509656ccd0de0de4f75e1b4d0/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257402497/94f4d5b9443e805509656ccd0de0de4f75e1b4d0/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1292278,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_erro